# 发布包和历史兼容解包目录；避免误伤名称中仅包含 "zip" 的源码。
*.zip
*_zip/
# build artifacts
**/build_out/
**/build/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
**/__pycache__/
PROF_*/
*.pyc
*.run
**/.local_opp/
**/.local_python/

# runtime / compile artifacts
**/kernel_meta/
**/extra-info/
**/*_profiling_output_record

# transient task tracker（ascendc-task-focus）；经验已沉淀进 *.md 报告
todo.md

# standardized performance/release layout
perf/runs/**/raw/
perf/runs/**/private/
perf/runs/**/profile/
perf/runs/**/PROF_*/
releases/**/private/
releases/**/extracted/
